        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Princess and the Frog, The Frog Princess, The Frog Prince\n- People: E. D. Baker, Brothers Grimm\n- Topics: Disney animated feature films, fairy tales\n\nFacts:\n- The Frog Prince; or, Iron Henry is a fairy tale best known through the Brothers Grimm's written version.\n- The Frog Prince; or, Iron Henry is traditionally the first story in the Brothers Grimm collection.\n- The Frog Princess is a novel by E. D. Baker that is based on the fairy tale The Frog Prince.\n- The Princess and the Frog is the 49th Disney animated feature film.\n- The Princess and the Frog is loosely based on E. D. Baker's novel The Frog Princess.",
